    "pros": [
      "30 g of protein per two-scoop serving, per the label",
      "About $1.39 per 25 g at full price, and far less on buy-one-get-one deals",
      "Easy to find: Walgreens lists it for store pickup in most locations"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "No NSF, Informed Sport or other third-party certification published",
      "Dextrose, maltodextrin, corn starch and sugar sit on the ingredient list",
      "The 4.5 g creatine, taurine and glutamine blend is proprietary, so amounts are not disclosed"
    ],
