        <div id="vs-amazon" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            7. Is Protein Powder Cheaper at Walgreens or on Amazon?
          </h2>

          <p>
            Name-brand protein is cheaper on Amazon in almost every case we checked, by anywhere from about 0% to 70%, while Walgreens' own whey is the cheapest per gram of anything in a Walgreens store. The gap is smallest on Optimum Nutrition's small tub, which costs about the same in both places, and biggest on Premier Protein shakes and the small Orgain tub.
