            For Orgain's 1.02 lb tub, about 10 servings times 21 g is 210 g, or 8.4 portions: $19.98 on Amazon is about $2.38 per 25 g, and $26.99 at Walgreens is about $3.21. Premier shakes: a 12-pack holds 360 g of protein, or 14.4 portions, so $26.74 on Amazon is about $1.86 per 25 g, while a $15.49 Walgreens four-pack holds 4.8 portions, about $3.23. These are snapshots; both retailers move prices weekly.
